This directory redistributes the following unmodified components, bundled into
the Voidcast tools-server binary (see tts-server/voidcast-tools-server.spec) to
provide fully offline speech-to-text:

  - whistle.cact      Whistle ASR model weights (~16.9 MB)
                      https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/whistle
                      License: Apache-2.0

  - libneedle.dll     needle native inference engine (Windows x64)
                      https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle3
                      License: Apache-2.0

The cactus-needle Python package (https://pypi.org/project/cactus-needle/) is
installed as a runtime dependency (tts-server/requirements-tools.txt) and is
also licensed under Apache-2.0.

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 text that governs these components is provided
in the sibling LICENSE file. These files are redistributed unmodified; Voidcast
does not alter the needle engine or the Whistle weights.

Whistle supports English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Dutch and Polish.
